 abstract = {In the context of rapid social progress, information and network technology are also in rapid development, and the current integrated routing/switching solution is the best application of MPLS technology, the reason is that it has its own unique advantages, that is, according to its own flexibility and simplicity of the characteristics of the IP path seamless link. Let the advantages of the switch and router perfectly merge. In general, IP technology has the characteristics of flexibility and scalability. When these characteristics are matched with the flow control and high-performance functions of ATM technology, the combination of the two is enough to be a hot topic in the current industry. The basic idea is to Label a data stream with a short Label. According to the label, the network node will know the characteristics such as the destination of the data stream and can complete the datagram forwarding after a series of processing. In this article through the thought of, in-depth studies are based on MPLS VPN technology in the construction of engineering efforts to complete the whole project, set out to solve the related technical problems of VPN based on MPLS technology platform, the platform based on MPLS technology of VPN technology ASIC project completion, the current society has put the chip into production. It lays a solid foundation for network operators in the construction of virtual private network. Nowadays, the main direction of VPN development is IP virtual private network (IP/VPN) based on MPLS. In this paper, the working principle and technical characteristics of MPLS VPN are briefly introduced, and three specific access methods of using MPLSVPN technology to build virtual private network of party school systems are introduced in detail.  © 2020 ACM.},
